<amll:meta key="appleMusicId" value="1491477512"/></metadata></head><body dur="4:50.265"><div begin="14.035" end="39.550" itunes:songPart="Verse"><p begin="14.035" end="19.663" itunes:key="L1" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="14.035" end="15.135">也许是</span><span begin="15.135" end="15.666">不</span><span begin="15.666" end="16.426">甘心</span> <span begin="17.215" end="18.280">也许是</span><span begin="18.280" end="18.725">可</span><span begin="18.725" end="19.663">惜</span></p><p begin="20.609" end="26.020" itunes:key="L2" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="20.609" end="21.229">也许</span><span begin="21.229" end="22.045">无法</span><span begin="22.045" end="22.766">相信</span> <span begin="22.959" end="23.701">突然身边</span><span begin="23.952" end="24.469">再也</span><span begin="24.775" end="25.153">不</span><span begin="25.153" end="25.455">是</span><span begin="25.455" end="26.020">你</span></p><p begin="26.312" end="32.675" itunes:key="L3" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="26.312" end="27.221">能给的</span><span begin="27.221" end="27.676">都</span><span begin="27.676" end="28.358">已经</span><span begin="28.358" end="28.823">给你</span> <span begin="29.694" end="30.499">能做的</span><span begin="30.499" end="30.954">都</span><span begin="30.954" end="31.619">用尽</span><span begin="31.619" end="32.675">全力</span></p><p begin="32.844" end="39.550" itunes:key="L4" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="32.844" end="33.407">也许</span><span begin="33.407" end="34.688">遇见你</span><span begin="34.688" end="35.334">是种</span><span begin="35.334" end="36.338">幸运</span> <span begin="36.888" end="37.520">分开</span><span begin="37.520" end="38.326">却是</span><span begin="38.326" end="38.786">天</span><span begin="38.786" end="39.550">意</span></p></div><div begin="40.315" end="1:05.746" itunes:songPart="Verse"><p begin="40.315" end="45.831" itunes:key="L5" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="40.315" end="41.165">不是</span><span begin="41.165" end="41.919">不能</span><span begin="41.919" end="42.804">面对</span> <span begin="43.475" end="44.487">又不是</spa